<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2JN" style="id">- Ngoni Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">2 Yohani</para>
  <para style="toc3">2 Yoh</para>
  <para style="toc1">Balua ya pili yeyiyandikwi na Yohani</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Yohani</para>
  <para style="mt2">Balua ya pili yeyiyandikwi na</para>
  <para style="mt1">Yohani</para>
  <para style="imt">Ulongolelu</para>
  <para style="ip">Balua ya 2 Yohani yiyandikwi na Mtumi Yohani pagati ya mwaka 90 peamali kuvelekewa Yesu Kilisitu. Yohani ajimanyisi lepi mwene ngati myandika, nambu pahala paki akujikemela mgogo.</para>
  <para style="ip">Mambu gegavi mubalua iyi ya 2 Yohani giwanangana papipi neju na gala gegavi mugati ya Linenu la Bwina ngati cheyiyandikwi na Yohani.</para>
  <para style="ip">Lenili lilolekana hotohoto neju pala peikangamalisa muhilu waki wa kuganana, na cheijova kumgana Yesu ndi pamonga na kuzilanda mihilu yaki 2 Yohani (musula za 1:5-6; Yohani 15:9-10).</para>
  <para style="ip">Yisadikika kuvya Yohani ayandiki Linenu la Bwina ngati cheyiyandikwi na Yohani pamonga na balua zaki zidatu ndi 1 Yohani, 2 Yohani, na 3 Yohani lukumbi peatamili pamuji wa ku Efeso.</para>
  <para style="ip">Yohani ayandiki balua yeniyi kwa mdala muhaguliwa pamonga na vana vaki. Kwa malovi ago ndi avayandikili msambi wa vandu vevakumsadika Kilisitu.</para>
  <para style="ip">Kangi ijova mubalua yeniyo yavili ndava ya vandu voha vevakumsadika Kilisitu.</para>
  <para style="ip">Yohani ayandiki balua yeniyi ndava ya kuvakangamalisa mtima msambi wa vandu vevakumsadika Kilisitu na kuvajovela vajiyangalilayi na vawula va udesi.</para>
  <para style="iot">Gegavi</para>
  <para style="io">Yohani akuyimanyisa balua yaki na kuvadandaulila akuvayandikili vayani na kangi akuvajambusa, 2 Yohani (musula ya 1:1-3).</para>
  <para style="io">Kangi akuvakangamalisa mtima vandu vevakumsadika Kilisitu na kuvakumbusa ndava muhilu ukulu kuhotola woha 2 Yohani (musula ya 1:4-6).</para>
  <para style="io">Kangi akuvajovela vajiyangalila na vawula va udesi, 2 Yohani (musula ya 1:7-11).</para>
  <para style="io">Mewawa Yohani imalakisila balua kwa kuvajambusa kwa kuvalaga 2 Yohani (musula ya 1:12-13).</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2JN 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2JN 1:1" />Nene gogo chilongosi, nikuyandikila veve Wamawu mweuhaguliwi na Chapanga pamonga na vana vaku venivaganili kwa mtima wangu woha. Namwene lepi mwenivaganili nambu na vala vevaumanyili uchakaka vavaganili nyenye, <verse eid="2JN 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2JN 1:2" />tivaganili ndava muni uchakaka uwu utama mugati yitu na yati uvya na tete hati magono goha gangali mwishu.<verse eid="2JN 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2JN 1:3" />Dadi Chapanga pamonga na Yesu Kilisitu, Mwana wa Dadi, vakutipela ubwina na lipyana na uteke, vindu ivyo vivyai pamonga na tete muuchakaka na uganu.<verse eid="2JN 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Uchakaka na Uganu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2JN 1:4" />Nasangalwiki neju panavaweni vana vaku vangi vitama muuchakaka ngati Dadi Chapanga cheatilagizi. <verse eid="2JN 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2JN 1:5" />Hinu, Mau mweuhaguliwi na Chapanga nivi na luyupu lumonga kwaku, tigananayi. Muhilu uwu wamupya lepi, ndi lilalila latavili nalu kuhuma utumbukanu nikuyupa tiganana. <verse eid="2JN 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2JN 1:6" />Wenuwu ndi uganu, ndi kutama kwa kuyidakila mihilu ya Chapanga. Ngati chemwatumbwili kuyuwana, muhilu uwu mganikiwa kutama kwa uganu.<verse eid="2JN 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2JN 1:7" />Muni vadese vamahele vahumalili pamulima, vandu vangayidakila kuvya Yesu Kilisitu abwelili kwitu ngati mundu. Mundu mweijova chenicho ndi mdese na akumbela Kilisitu. <verse eid="2JN 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2JN 1:8" />Mujiyangalila mwavene muni mkoto kuyagisa gala gemwagahengelili lihengu, nambu mkakita chenicho mwipata lepi njombi yinu yeyitimiliki.<verse eid="2JN 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2JN 1:9" />Mundu yeyoha mweangatama mu mawuliwu ga Kilisitu, nambu akugaleka mambu gangi mu mawuliwu ago mundu mwenuyo avi lepi na Chapanga ndi mweilanda mawuliwu ago avi navu voha vavili, Dadi na Mwana. <verse eid="2JN 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2JN 1:10" />Ngati mundu akabwelayi kwinu changali kuvaletela mawuliwu ga Kilisitu, mkoto kumpokela kunyumba yinu amala kumjambusa. <verse eid="2JN 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2JN 1:11" />Yeyoha mweakumpokela mundu mwenuyo, ndi iwungana nayu mukukita mambu gahakau.<verse eid="2JN 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Linenu la kumalakisila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2JN 1:12" />Nivi nagu gamahele ga kuvajovela, nambu mbwitu kukita chenicho kwa kuvayandikila. Nambu nigana kubwela tilongela mihu kwa mihu muni luheku lwitu lukamilikayi.<verse eid="2JN 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2JN 1:13" />Vana va mlumbu waku mweahaguliwi na Chapanga vakujambusa.<verse eid="2JN 1:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2JN 1" />
</usx>